OL,3,GNEWSAThe tanker explosion that
OL,4,Adevastated a village high street
OL,5,
OL,6,FExactly 50 years ago, on 11 September
OL,7,F1976, a petrol tanker overturned and
OL,8,Fexploded in a quiet village, making
OL,9,Fnational headlines.
OL,11,FAt about 07:15 BST on a Saturday
OL,12,Fmorning, flames engulfed the vehicle
OL,13,Fand houses on either side of the High
OL,14,FStreet in Westoning, Bedfordshire.
OL,16,FFamilies asleep in bed were forced to
OL,17,Fflee their homes to escape the fire,
OL,18,Fwhich also destroyed a bakery,
OL,19,Fbutcher's shop and the village post
OL,20,Foffice.
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
