OL,3,GNEWSAThe tanker explosion that
OL,4,Adevastated a village high street
OL,5,
OL,6,FFive thousand gallons (23,000 litres)
OL,7,Fof petrol exploded almost immediately
OL,8,Fafter the tanker crashed, but the
OL,9,Fdriver managed to scramble clear and no
OL,10,Flives were lost.
